------------------------------------------------------------------------------
WHICH NETLIST, AND WHY NOT THE GOLDEN .sp
------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Compared against primitives/lvs_compare.spice, the geometry-equivalent VIEW of the
frozen golden netlist, exactly as in pass 1. It folds MOS w to w*m and normalizes
nf/m to 1 because the sky130 netgen setup deletes nf/mult while Magic merges a
folded device back to total width -- against the golden .sp every nf>1 device would
report a width delta of exactly nf, burying any real mismatch. It also declares the
three tie-off dummies (XDUMMY1/2/3) that glayout draws and Magic legitimately
extracts. The file was present as required; no silent fallback occurred.
The golden .sp remains frozen, authoritative and UNMODIFIED.

